ing"}],"gloss":"overflowing the eyelids"},{"surface":"ஊறும்","parts":[{"text":"ஊறு","lemma":"ஊறு","gloss":"ooze/flow"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"oozing"},{"surface":"கண்பனி","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"பனி","lemma":"பனி","gloss":"tear/dew"}],"gloss":"eye-tears"},{"surface":"மதரெழில்","parts":[{"text":"மதர்","lemma":"மதர்","gloss":"abundance/pride"},{"text":"எழில்","lemma":"எழில்","gloss":"beauty"}],"gloss":"proud beauty"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பூணக","parts":[{"text":"பூண்","lemma":"பூண்","gloss":"ornament"},{"text":"அக","lemma":"அகம்","gloss":"inside/chest"}],"gloss":"adorned with ornaments"},{"surface":"வனமுலை","parts":[{"text":"வனம்","lemma":"வனம்","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"முலை","lemma":"முலை","gloss":"breast"}],"gloss":"beautiful breasts"},{"surface":"நனைத்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"நனை","lemma":"நனை","gloss":"wet"},{"text":"த்தல்","lemma":"த்தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and/even"}],"gloss":"wetting them"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காணார்","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"they (negative)"}],"gloss":"does he not see"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"மாணிழை","parts":[{"text":"மாண்","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"excellent"},{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"jewels"}],"gloss":"O you of excellent jewels"},{"surface":"நமரே","parts":[{"text":"நமர்","lemma":"நமர்","gloss":"our man/lover"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"our man"}]}],"literal":"They themselves will go on the path of the forest, / where, left behind between the tusks of elephants seeking pasture, / spreading from the branch of the small-flowered jasmine, / overflowing the eyelids, oozing eye-tears, on the proudly beautiful / breasts adorned with ornaments, wet them; does he not see this, / indeed, O you of excellent jewels, our man?","translation":"Our man travels by himself on the forest path. Does he not see how the tears from your eyes, overflowing your eyelids and oozing down, wet your beautiful breasts adorned with ornaments, like the small-flowered jasmine spreading from its branch, left behind between the tusks of wild elephants searching for pasture?","modern":"மேய்ச்சல் நிலத்தைத் தேடும் யானைகளின் தந்தங்களுக்கு இடையே சிக்கித் தப்பிய, சிறிய மலர்களைக் கொண்ட முல்லைக் கொடியின் கிளையிலிருந்து உதிர்ந்து பரவுவது போல, இமைகளைக் கடந்து பெருகி வழியும் கண்ணீரானது, அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த உன்னுடைய அழகான மார்பகங்களை நனைப்பதை, நம் காதலர் காணமாட்டாரோ? அவர் தாமே அந்த வறண்ட காட்டு வழியில் செல்கின்றார்.","explanation":"The friend speaks to the heroine to console her during the hero's separation. The hero has departed on a journey through the dry forest path to acquire wealth. The friend notices the heroine's intense grief, with tears overflowing her eyelids and wetting her beautiful breasts. She compares these tears to the delicate jasmine flowers falling from their branches, which were caught and left behind between the tusks of wild elephants searching for pasture. The friend wonders aloud if the hero, who travels through such forests, does not realize or see the pain his departure causes, symbolized by these tears. This poignant comparison of the delicate jasmine on elephant tusks to tears on the heroine's breasts beautifully captures the harshness of the pālai landscape and the tenderness of her love.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.61],[0.61,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.64,2.18],[2.18,3.0],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,4.28],[4.39,4.5],[4.5,5.0],[5.0,5.0],[5.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,6.0],[6.0,9.5],[9.5,10.5],[10.5,10.7],[10.7,11.3],[11.3,11.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.79],[0.79,1.11],[1.15,1.3],[1.42,2.6],[2.6,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.37,3.7],[3.7,4.7],[4.7,4.77],[4.77,4.8],[5.28,6.0],[6.0,7.15],[7.15,7.15],[7.15,7.15],[7.15,7.15],[7.15,7.15],[7.15,7.15],[7.15,8.3],[8.3,11.3],[11.3,11.6],[11.6,12.3],[12.3,12.5]]}}